# TikTok — verified 2026-11-07
# TikTok-only names from the TikTok-Unlock list. snssdk.com stays in Douyin.
# Overseas edges of the shared CDNs are listed here by prefix. Domestic names
# on those suffixes stay in Douyin.list, which is placed after this ruleset.
# https://github.com/Semporia/TikTok-Unlock/blob/master/Surge/TikTok.list
DOMAIN,p16-tiktokcdn-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteoversea.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muscdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,musical.ly
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sgpstatp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tik-tokapi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokv.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,-tiktokcdn-com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,-tiktok-

